{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And the assembly was gathered, etc.</b> Perhaps it is because when they saw the act of Moses — that he took Aaron and his sons and the garments, etc. — they assembled of their own accord. Or it may intend to inform us that the place held all of Israel at the entrance of the Tent of Meeting, as they of blessed memory expounded (Leviticus Rabbah 10:9) regarding the section of ״הַקְהֵל״, etc., and here the verse informs us that this was indeed so."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:54:10.601661660Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}